{"product_id":"abe-lincolns-hat-step-into-reading","title":"Abe Lincoln's Hat (Step into Reading)","description":"\u003cp\u003eHow do you remember things? President Abraham Lincoln used a special trick -- he placed reminders under his top hat! Read all about it and more in this leveled reader perfect for President's Day and for anyone looking to discover fun facts about one of our nation's greatest presidents!This Step 3 History Reader shares some fascinating anecdotes about Abraham Lincoln, one of our greatest presidents. Abe started out in life as an absent-minded frontier lawyer. How did he nudge his memory? He stuck letters, court notes, contracts, and even his checkbook in his trademark top hat. When he took off his hat, it was all there! Young readers will be utterly engaged with how Abe's humanity comes across in this accessible, easy-to-read book.Step 3 Readers feature engaging characters in easy-to-follow plots about popular topics. These books are for children who are ready to read on their own.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Martha Brenner\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780679849773\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738230644889,"sku":"5RD9780679849773","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68cf8efb78559_Abe_Lincoln_s_Hat__Step_into_Reading__Martha_Brenner.jpg?v=1758560072","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/abe-lincolns-hat-step-into-reading","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}